@startuml Activity_Detect_Pest_Disease
title Activity Diagram: Detect Pest or Disease from Plant Photo (UC-017)

|User|
start
:Suspect plant health issue;
:Navigate to "Pest Detection" feature;

|System|
:Display camera upload interface;

|User|
if (Take new photo or upload?) then (take new)
  :Capture photo of affected plant\nusing smartphone camera;
else (upload)
  :Select existing photo from gallery;
endif

|System|
:Receive image;
:Validate image format and size;

if (Valid format (JPG/PNG/HEIC)\nAND size <10MB\nAND resolution ≥300x300px?) then (yes)
  :Display "Analyzing..." loading indicator;

  |AI/ML Service|
  :Send image to TensorFlow\nML model via API;

  if (ML service available?) then (yes)
    :Preprocess image\n(resize, normalize);
    :Run ResNet-50 CNN model;
    :Extract feature vectors;
    :Classify pest/disease;
    :Generate top 3 predictions\nwith confidence scores;
    :Return results to system;

    |System|
    :Receive identification results;

    if (Highest confidence ≥70%?) then (yes)
      :Display primary identification\n(pest/disease name);
      :Show confidence score (e.g., 92%);

      fork
        :Display pest/disease details\n(appearance, lifecycle, damage pattern);
      fork again
        :Show treatment recommendations;

        fork
          :Organic options\n(neem oil, introduce ladybugs);
        fork again
          :Chemical options\n(specific insecticides);
        fork again
          :Preventive measures;
        end fork
      end fork

      |User|
      if (Create treatment task?) then (yes)
        :Select treatment method\n(e.g., "Apply neem oil spray");

        |System|
        :Create task in calendar;
        :Set task date and reminders;
        :Save task to database;
        note right: Task created with\nrecommended treatment
      else (no)
        :User takes note of recommendations;
      endif

      |System|
      :Save detection record\nin farm history;
      :Store: image, identification,\nconfidence, timestamp, farm ID;

      |User|
      if (Save image to improve model?) then (yes)
        |System|
        :Store anonymized image\nfor model retraining;
        note right: User consent obtained\nfor data collection
      else (no)
        :Image not saved;
      endif

      :User proceeds with treatment;

    else (confidence <70%)
      :Display "Unable to confidently identify";
      :Show top 3 possible matches\nwith confidence scores;
      :Suggest actions;

      |User|
      if (What action to take?) then (retake photo)
        :Take clearer photo\nwith better lighting;
        -[#blue]-> Validate image format and size;
      else (post to forum)
        |System|
        :Navigate to community forum;
        :Auto-populate post with image;
        :User describes symptoms;
        :Submit for expert review;
        stop
      else (try later)
        :Save for later analysis;
        stop
      endif
    endif

  else (service unavailable)
    |System|
    :Display error\n"Service temporarily unavailable";
    :Log failure for admin review;
    :Suggest alternatives;

    |User|
    if (What to do?) then (try again later)
      :Queue image for later processing;
      :System will notify when complete;
      stop
    else (post to forum)
      :Navigate to community forum;
      :Post image for human expert review;
      stop
    endif
  endif

else (invalid)
  |System|
  :Display error message\n"Please upload JPG/PNG under 10MB";

  |User|
  :Select different image;
  -[#blue]-> Validate image format and size;
endif

stop

note right of System
  **Performance Requirements:**
  - Image analysis <10 seconds
  - Min 80% accuracy for common pests
  - Offline mode: queue for later

  **ML Model Details:**
  - ResNet-50 architecture
  - Trained on 10,000+ images
  - 50+ common pests/diseases
  - Monthly model retraining
end note

@enduml
